<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan to host meeting on palm oil trade.</title>
<headline>Pakistan to host meeting on palm oil trade.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A palm oil conference focusing on quality preservation and trading practices will open in Karachi on Tuesday, a member of the Pakistan Vanaspati Manufacturers Association (PVMA) said on Monday.</p>
<p>He said the conference had been organised jointly by PVMA and the Palm Oil Research Institute of Malaysia.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
